WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.333
Today your child writes words inside a sentence. Then there is a story.

2
00:00:04.783 --> 00:00:06.399
These are today's two pages.

3
00:00:06.849 --> 00:00:12.559
In each sentence, a picture stands for a word. Your child writes that word on the line beside it.

4
00:00:13.009 --> 00:00:19.254
There are no boxes and no dots today. Your child says the word, taps it on the table, and writes it.

5
00:00:19.704 --> 00:00:23.507
Then your child reads the whole sentence back, to hear if it makes sense.

6
00:00:23.957 --> 00:00:27.677
Do the first sentence together. Then name the pictures in job two.

7
00:00:28.127 --> 00:00:34.853
Your child finishes the three sentences alone. Then press play. The voice waits, then reads each sentence.

8
00:00:35.303 --> 00:00:39.425
Then turn to the story. Every word in it is one your child can read.

9
00:00:39.875 --> 00:00:43.775
Let them read it to you. Then let them read it to someone else in the family.
